<title>USA: Paradigm says McClelland resigns as CFO.</title>
<headline>Paradigm says McClelland resigns as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paradigm Technology Inc said Robert McClelland, Paradigm's Chief Financial Officer, is leaving the company and will be replaced by Paradigm's controller, Douglas Schirle.</p>
<p>Schirle has been corporate controller of Paradigm since January of 1994.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
